WEBVTT

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.810
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:19.190
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:22.730
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:26.480
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.060
On their way to the Windland Snow Mountain,
Kasel and Roi encounter an undead.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:35.980
It was one of Roi's former companions.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.480
Captain...

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.600
I'll lay you to rest!

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.020
Roi finds closure with his past.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:50.270
Kasel and the others continue their journey
with renewed determination.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:57.100
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:02.310
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:12.710
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:17.190
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:21.730
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:26.980
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:31.650
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.980
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.810
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:41.440
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.940
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:47.900
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:51.310
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:56.230
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:58.900
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.100
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.520
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.980
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:09.190
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:13.060
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.910
<i></i>Hidden

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.910
<i></i>Determination

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:44.020
That is a majestic mountain...
Not inviting in the slightest.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.440
Yes.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.850
We're finally going to meet Master Pavel!

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.940
Oh, I'm so excited!

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:54.100
The nocturnal sun is about
to cover up the moon.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:57.150
We have to get Master Pavel
to unlock the seal before that happens.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.810
Yes.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:03.060
But seriously, how empty is this place?

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:07.600
It's not a surprise to hear Pavel
hasn't met anyone in 100 years.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:10.400
Master Pavel is the sorcerer among sorcerers,

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.060
the super great, super, super sorcerer!

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:16.150
You don't get to meet him easily!

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:20.900
Master Lorraine said
Master Pavel lives in an ice cave.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:24.810
I hope we don't miss it.
The scenery hasn't changed one bit.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:27.310
There's supposed to be a clue, I think.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.270
Umm, there's a log cabin along the path,

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:34.850
and then there's a rock
with a hole in it, I think?

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:39.440
Rock with a hole?
Well, let's try to find that log cabin first.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.850
What's that sound...?

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.980
Here comes a big one!

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.270
Watch out!

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.770
Not on my watch!

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:06.940
Thanks.

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:12.980
Who would have thought there'd
be Demons way out here?

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:16.730
Perhaps this means the Demons
are gaining power.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.480
Yeah...

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:21.020
All right, let's go.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.520
What's with this wind?!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.020
We can't even move forward!

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.150
Let's try to stick together.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.900
Someone say something funny...

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:43.940
What?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.600
We can't hear you! Speak up!

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:49.310
Someone say something funny!

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.690
Shut up! Stay quiet for a bit!

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.440
We can't keep going like this...

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.650
It's gotten better.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.060
Yeah.

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:41.690
Is that the log cabin?

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:45.230
Hmm? Yeah, probably.

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:47.940
What should we do? Rest?

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.850
At the rate we're going, everyone's okay, right?
We're running out of time, so...

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:53.940
I'm fine, but...

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.900
I'm fine.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.400
Me, too...

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.730
Frey?!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:06.020
I'm sorry... I'm weighing you down.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:10.940
Not at all. Kasel and Roi are bringing water.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:14.730
I'll grind up some herbs. You rest.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.230
Thank you...

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:35.100
It smells nice... Is it chamomile?

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:42.770
Frey, I think I know what's
causing your symptoms.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:52.150
I forced Frey to push herself too hard.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:56.190
I thought, since I'm okay,
everyone else should be, too.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:08:00.150
Same with me. Not everyone
has the same stamina.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.850
We should rest here tonight.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.650
Yes.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:07.730
We have to rest, for Frey's sake. But...

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:14.730
Frey, are you okay?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.230
Yes, I feel a lot better now.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.940
Come on, let's boil some water!

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:31.480
Your Highness, shouldn't we
depart when the sun rises?

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:37.270
Riheet said the attacker was a Demon
stronger than anything he has fought.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.980
Also, the Dark Lord might be close to returning.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:44.350
We must prepare a way
to fight back before he does.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:46.730
A way to fight back?

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.770
I will travel to the Tower of
the Sage to meet Dominix.

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.350
We need his help.

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:57.190
I understand.

00:08:57.190 --> 00:09:03.900
But what about Riheet? Should we take him
back to Orvelia, or leave him here...

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.270
It's up to him.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:15.400
We wanted to oppress the oppressor
and take over the kingdom.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:20.150
Is there no way to ask for his help anymore...?

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:46.850
Go to the Tower of the Sage.
Illya's lab was there.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:51.190
The False Sword that she left
behind should be there, too.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.940
I will find Illya's False Sword...!

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:11.230
Who are you?

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.560
Kasel?

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.400
I'm going to go get some fresh air.

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.600
Oh, the cold air feels good!

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:48.770
Are you feeling all right?

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.770
I'm fine. I feel pretty good, actually.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:54.810
What about you though, Kasel?

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:58.440
I just kind of woke up...

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:03.520
Did you have a bad dream?

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:12.020
Actually, recently,
I've been having the same dream.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:15.600
Someone calls out to me in my dream...

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.980
I can't see their face.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:22.440
Is it a friend? Or an enemy?

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:24.520
I'm in a lot of pain...

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.850
It's been happening since I got the power
of the Holy Sword in Ogria Mountain.

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:35.270
Mr. Kasel enters the world as a hero
and rushes down on a path of war.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:38.560
Further down the path, he disappears.

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:45.730
Perhaps the Holy Sword is trying
to tell me something.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:48.560
But I can't understand what it is at all.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.560
I might be the heir to the Holy Sword,

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.810
but I'm definitely not its "user" yet.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.190
I hope you don't see scary dreams again.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.400
What are you doing all of a sudden?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:14.270
When we were small,
you used to have scary dreams a lot.

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:17.690
I used to pat you on the head
like this every time.

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:23.900
Then, we both thought long and hard about food.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.730
What's for breakfast?

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:32.560
Chestnut stew? Bread with lots of berry jam?

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:37.850
After a while, the sun would rise,
and we'd forget about the dream.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:40.730
So for now, let's think about food.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:41.730
Like spiders?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:45.770
Yes! A big, juicy deep-fried spider!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:48.600
What?! You can eat spiders now?

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:52.520
No! Never in my life!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.730
Wait! Don't move.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.190
A snow bug!

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.730
Oh, wow!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:14.310
I haven't seen one in such a long time!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.770
There's another one!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.810
Huh?

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.230
Hey, wait!

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.350
Frey!

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:31.400
Sorry.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:35.980
Let's go back now.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.100
When this is all over...

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:47.810
...let's go back to Orvelia together.

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:49.230
Yeah.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:12.770
Hey.

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.770
Roi...

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:17.230
Where are you going so early in the morning?

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:19.480
What's this note you left?

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:25.980
I'll take the rest of the trip alone.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.400
I'll take the rest of the trip alone.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:42.690
You and Cleo were only told by Mr. Dominix
to take me to Master Pavel, right?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.350
Maybe.

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:50.310
If the weather holds,
I can meet Master Pavel by myself. So...

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:55.730
So you want us to take Frey to Orvelia?

00:14:57.020 --> 00:15:01.730
Frey always cares more about
others than herself, right?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:04.690
I think the journey is only going
to get harder from here.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:07.690
I don't want anything bad to happen to Frey...

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.020
It's to protect her.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.980
You arrogant show-off!

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:14.810
Do you really think you can
do this by yourself?!

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.230
I'll trade in my life if I have to...

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:22.900
If you died, Frey would drown in sorrow
for the rest of her life.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:28.770
"Why wasn't I able to protect Kasel?
Why did I let him go alone?"

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:37.900
You of all people should know
how hard it is to be left behind.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.270
Is that really what you want for Frey?

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:46.940
It's true, Cleo and I were sent by Dominix.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.060
But that's no longer
the only reason why we're here.

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:57.190
During our travels, we fought together,
and shared many things.

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.810
We're friends now.

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:03.770
Cleo and I are already committed to this.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:06.690
Are you still going to go alone?

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.980
Roi...

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.560
Roi's right!

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:15.270
It's all thanks to Frey
that we're healthy like this!

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:21.100
Frey, I think I know
what's causing your symptoms.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:26.400
You've almost used up all of your magic.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:29.440
I guess there's no hiding the truth from you.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:31.230
I knew it...

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:34.480
Idiot! People die from that, you know!

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:39.940
We felt like traveling got a lot easier
because the wind died down, right?

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:43.400
That was Frey.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:47.730
Wait... So Frey was casting
magic on us the whole time?!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.600
Exactly.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:56.400
Frey made it possible for us
to push forward in those harsh conditions.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:59.850
Frey is risking her life to protect us!

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:07.650
I was starting to notice it...

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:12.270
But I never thought she would go so far
as to push herself until she fainted.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:17.520
I'm sorry, Frey... We were
totally taking you for granted.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:20.810
No, it's okay.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.400
When I saw this mountain, I made up my mind.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:30.230
If something happens along the way,
I'll do everything I can to protect everyone,

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:33.560
so that the three of you
can continue the journey.

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.520
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.480
If you got knocked out
because of that, there's no point!

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:45.310
We can't continue this trip
if we're missing even one of us!

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:48.520
The four of us are together until the end!

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:04.480
I thought I was on this journey
to protect everyone...

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.850
But...

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:10.520
Instead of being the protector,
I was being protected the whole time.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:15.060
That's right. You can fight
because we're with you!

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:19.730
Never try to go off on your own again!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:22.270
Got it!

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:30.480
I woke up and everyone was gone,
I was surprised.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.100
The weather is nice today.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:39.980
Frey, I'm sorry. The only thing
on my mind was to move forward.

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:43.560
If I had paid attention to everyone,
I would have noticed right away...

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.440
No, I also...

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:49.940
I want the four of us to finish
this journey together.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.350
So if anything happens,
let me know immediately.

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:56.480
Please promise me that you won't
push yourself excessively.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:59.310
I promise. So...

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:02.230
Same applies to you, Kasel.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:05.190
Y-Yeah... I understand.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.940
Cleo.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.060
Here.

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:30.310
Split up and pack each squad's luggage. Hurry!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:34.770
Are you leaving? You will be missed.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.270
The children were absolutely infatuated
with you, Princess Scarlet.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.770
Here...

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.440
Thank you, Elise.

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.850
These sweets are truly delicious.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:50.810
I will enjoy having them during my travels.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:53.230
Let's make them together next time.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.190
Me? Making sweets?

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:59.730
Elise, the princess does not...

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:06.650
I never imagined such a thing,
but it might be fun.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:10.560
I can hold cooking tools
in my hands instead of a sword,

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.940
once the world achieves peace.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.900
Once the world achieves peace? Is that tomorrow?

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:22.060
It's soon.

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:30.810
I don't want people like that
to suffer or cry any longer.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:34.310
I will do everything in my power for that.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:40.980
Do you know how to get
to the Tower of the Sage?

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:44.480
Why do you ask?

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:47.940
It's none of your business. Tell me now.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:53.690
I will tell you. But first you must
clearly tell me why you wish to go.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.440
The False Sword by Illya?!

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:07.560
Fine. I also have business
at the Tower of the Sage.

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:11.190
<i>This one wish</i>

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:13.900
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:16.690
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:20.730
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:37.310
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:43.190
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:47.810
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:21:47.810 --> 00:21:54.480
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:59.940
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:02.230
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:05.650
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:08.310
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:11.190
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:13.940
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:16.730
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.520
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:22.270
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:25.100
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:28.060
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:45.520 --> 00:22:46.810
That's...

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:53.020
Is that the marker?

00:22:55.230 --> 00:22:57.190
A cave!

00:22:57.190 --> 00:23:00.230
We can finally meet Master Pavel!

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:06.940
Hello! Master Pavel?

00:23:11.060 --> 00:23:12.100
Let's go inside.

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:13.150
Yeah.

00:23:13.150 --> 00:23:14.690
Excuse us.

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:28.810
What is this?!

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:29.980
Kasel!

00:23:29.980 --> 00:23:31.150
Dammit!

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:33.020
What is this...?

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:39.730
Are you...?

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:52.650
